COMPILATION OF: E48D1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D1

   1 a 0000 E48D1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] static CHARACTER VARYING as an OPEN TITLE
   4 a 0006      operand, OUTPUT side -- E46F5's own shape, re-measured with a
   5 a 0006      distinct module name so the object is a fresh witness. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file,
   7 c 0006       nm char(14) varying static initial('AB'),
   8 c 0006       k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title(nm);
  10 c 0021   put file(outf) list('X');
  11 c 003B   close file(outf);
  12 c 0041   stop;
  13 a 0044 end E48D1;

CODE SIZE = 0044
DATA AREA = 0012
FREE SYMS = 38AC
END  COMPILATION
